Hospital Appointment Booking System – Project Details
Project Title
Hospital Appointment Booking System
Project Domain
Web Application Development
Project Abstract
The Hospital Appointment Booking System is a web-based application developed to simplify the appointment scheduling process between patients and doctors. The system allows patients to register, log in, view doctor details, and book appointments online. Administrators can manage doctors, patients, and appointment requests through an admin dashboard.
This project reduces manual work, minimizes patient waiting time, and improves the efficiency of hospital appointment management. The system stores all information securely in a database and provides easy access to appointment records.
Problem Statement
In many hospitals, appointment booking is still managed manually, which can lead to long waiting times, scheduling conflicts, and inefficient record management. Patients often need to visit the hospital or make phone calls to book appointments.
The Hospital Appointment Booking System solves these problems by providing an online platform for appointment scheduling and management.
Objectives
Provide online appointment booking.
Reduce patient waiting time.
Manage doctor schedules efficiently.
Maintain patient records securely.
Improve hospital administration and service quality.
